rebuild.sh: Docker runs on aarch64, and its kernel runs x86-64 programs only under QEMU or not at all; dotnet aborts under QEMU. On an Apple Silicon Mac, use a Docker VM with Rosetta (colima start --vm-type vz --vz-rosetta). Linux on arm64 is not supported.
